  "translation": "Yoshiyahu ye ⟨את⟩ ko ɲɛbɔnnen bɛɛ bɔ duguw bɛɛ la minnu ye Yisraɛl denw ta, a ye Yisraɛl kɔnɔ minnu bien sɔrɔ kɛ Yawe, u Elohim, ladɔnnibagaw; a rew bɛɛ la, u ma bɔ Yawe, u bamaw Elohim, nɔ na.",
